        <div class="eum_check"><span class="eum_ck"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span>속쓰림 · 더부룩함 · 복통이 반복적으로 나타날 때</div>
